{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 324, "line_no": 24, "text": "五、布依族药物", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1559, "w": 266, "h": 51}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "五、布依族药物", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1559, "w": 266, "h": 51}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 324, "line_no": 25, "text": "布依族药物的命名有一定的规律，同一种药物，一般在三个土语区都有不同的称呼", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1625, "w": 1459, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族药物的命名有一定的规律，同一种药物，一般在三个土语区都有不同的称呼", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1625, "w": 1459, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 324, "line_no": 26, "text": "如：海金沙，第一土语区称为“归丘哈“［kut”tgu”xa\"］，第二土语区称为“把举在”［pak”", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1686, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "如：海金沙，第一土语区称为“归丘哈“［kut”tgu”xa\"］，第二土语区称为“把举在”［pak”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1686, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 324, "line_no": 27, "text": "tpi tsai”］，第三土语区称为“苦卡交腊”［ku”kak”tgau”zak”］。三个土语区对药物的称", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1746, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "tpi tsai”］，第三土语区称为“苦卡交腊”［ku”kak”tgau”zak”］。三个土语区对药物的称", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1746, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 324, "line_no": 28, "text": "呼各不相同，但对药物的命名方法基本相似。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1814, "w": 780, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "呼各不相同，但对药物的命名方法基本相似。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1814, "w": 780, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 324, "line_no": 29, "text": "布依族药物来源广泛，有来自花、果实、种子、根茎、叶类的植物药，也有来源于各种", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1872, "w": 1464, "h": 70}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族药物来源广泛，有来自花、果实、种子、根茎、叶类的植物药，也有来源于各种", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1872, "w": 1464, "h": 70}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 324, "line_no": 30, "text": "动物类的药物，还有出自矿物类及其他类的药物。每个药物名称中的第一个词素（或称", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1951, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "动物类的药物，还有出自矿物类及其他类的药物。每个药物名称中的第一个词素（或称", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1951, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
